  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/titles/easy_sit.png\" alt=\"easy sit datapack/mod title image minecraft\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/z2n3qTzQY6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/Discord.png\" alt=\"jodeks datapacks discord\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@jodek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/YouTube.png\" alt=\"datapacks jodek youtube\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/jodeks-datapacks/easy-sit/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/GH_Issues.png\" alt=\"easy sit minecraft datapack github issues\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjodek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/Kofi.png\" alt=\"jodeks datapacks kofi\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/Jodekq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/jodeks-datapacks/Assets@main/badges/GH_Sponsor.png\" alt=\"github sponsor jodek\"></a></p>\n<h2>運作方式</h2>\n<p><strong>右鍵模式</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><p>將視角完全朝下</p></li>\n<li><p>蹲下再站起</p></li>\n<li><p>按下右鍵</p></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>或執行 <code>/trigger sit</code> 坐下</strong></p>\n<h3>若要停止坐下，請按住 Shift</h3>\n<h2>設定檔</h2>\n<pre><code>/trigger easysit.config</code></pre>",
